              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova akuti, \"Kunena za pangano lake ndi iwo, Mzimu wanga umene uli pa inu, ndiponso mawu anga amene ndayika mʼkamwa mwanu sadzachoka mʼkamwa mwanu, kapena kuchoka mʼkamwa mwa ana anu, kapena mʼkamwa mwa zidzukulu zawo kuyambira tsopano mpaka kalekale,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.59.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.59.21"
            ]
          }
        }
